\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Changing the scalar without changing its marginal weight}
\date{2026-11-19}

\p{Fix a scalar at every site of the [orbit field](fdip-00ZW) and
sum over the links. A separate gauge at each site can carry this
scalar configuration to any prescribed one. Once an external factor
favors one of the scalar values, how much of the original link sum
still enters the relative weight of two scalar configurations?}
